title: "India Market Scanner: an Indian stock market scanner skill for Claude"
abstract: "A free, open-source Claude skill that scans NSE and BSE stocks, builds whole-share budget plans, checks holdings for red flags and sorts IPOs into listing-gain and long-term picks. Educational research tool, not investment advice."
